{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it comes to classic board games, nothing beats <i>Ludo</i>, the ultimate battle-style dice-and-race game! Four players each race to move their four pieces around the board and be the first to get them all to the goal. But... if you don\u2019t roll a six, you can\u2019t even get a piece out of the starting area!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, powerful new allies with unique abilities are entering the world of Ludo! Replacing the traditional pieces, these characters dash around the board in pursuit of victory! Train your characters, earn perks, manipulate dice rolls, and build a strategic team by combining the abilities of all four characters. Outsmart your opponents and claim the win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUnique characters with special skills\u2014stop opponents with specific rolls or target enemies from across the board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUnlock new characters by collecting points and spinning the gacha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your characters to unlock \u201cParks\u201d that influence dice outcomes and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine characters and Parks to create your ultimate winning strategy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630090?t=1758957708","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630090?t=1758957708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630090/167f1ea6f5811d4413a02287804c1dd22ab22270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758957708","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630090/167f1ea6f5811d4413a02287804c1dd22ab22270/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758957708","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it comes to classic board games, nothing beats <i>Ludo</i>, the ultimate battle-style dice-and-race game! Four players each race to move their four pieces around the board and be the first to get them all to the goal. But... if you don\u2019t roll a six, you can\u2019t even get a piece out of the starting area!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, powerful new allies with unique abilities are entering the world of Ludo! Replacing the traditional pieces, these characters dash around the board in pursuit of victory! Train your characters, earn perks, manipulate dice rolls, and build a strategic team by combining the abilities of all four characters. Outsmart your opponents and claim the win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUnique characters with special skills\u2014stop opponents with specific rolls or target enemies from across the board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUnlock new characters by collecting points and spinning the gacha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your characters to unlock \u201cParks\u201d that influence dice outcomes and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine characters and Parks to create your ultimate winning strategy!</p>","developers":["NekoKyoudai's"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630090/9f4a919ab369d04611c549b1b33a9489c3d5da2d/header.jpg?t=1758957708","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3630090/1498